---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Report an incident" description="Report pesticide spraying, misuse, exposure or poisoning to UnPoison through the existing secure intake route.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-current="page">Report an incident</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Spraying, exposure or poisoning</p>
    <h1>Report an incident</h1>
    <p class="lede">If you witnessed pesticide misuse, unsafe spraying, contamination, exposure or poisoning, your account can help show where policy and enforcement are failing.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section-compact section-rule">
    <div class="shell article-grid">
      <article class="article-body">
        <h2>Before you begin</h2>
        <p>The current report form asks for contact details, the place and date, what was applied, how it was applied, weather conditions and any health or environmental effects you observed.</p>
        <p>Photos or video may be useful. Do not put yourself at risk to collect evidence.</p>
        <h2>This form is still on the existing site</h2>
        <p>We are reviewing the form's privacy, storage and notification process before moving it. During this transition, the button opens the current UnPoison form in a new page.</p>
        <p>If there is an immediate medical emergency, contact local emergency or poison-information services first. This form is not monitored as an emergency channel.</p>
      </article>
      <aside class="article-aside">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legacy form</p>
        <h3>Ready to report?</h3>
        <p>Your personal information should not be published without review. Please avoid sending unnecessary sensitive details by email.</p>
        <a class="button" href="https://unpoison.org/submit-a-story/">Open the current report form <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="fine-print">If the form is unavailable, email <a href="mailto:unpoisonsa@gmail.com">unpoisonsa@gmail.com</a> for guidance.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
